---Submit Dispute
---
---Sends a dispute's evidence to the payment processor. This is final — it cannot be edited or sent again.
---
---`POST /disputes/{id}/submit`
---Errors: BadRequest, NotFound, Conflict.
---@param input whop.disputes.SubmitDisputeRequest
---@return whop.disputes.Dispute? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:submit_dispute(input) end

