---@param input whop.disputes.SubmitEvidenceDisputeRequest
---@return whop.disputes.LegacyDispute? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:submit_evidence_dispute(input) end

---Update Dispute
---
---Edits a dispute's evidence, while it is still editable. Sending it is a separate call. `evidence.documents`, when provided, replaces the full set of documents beyond the four fixed evidence slots — see its own description.
---
---`PATCH /disputes/{id}`
---Errors: BadRequest, NotFound.
---@param input whop.disputes.UpdateDisputeRequest
---@return whop.disputes.Dispute? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:update_dispute(input) end

